# CODEOWNERS: review routing for pull requests.
#
# Everything defaults to the repo owner, then a few control-plane and
# release-gated groups are called out explicitly so their review request
# never depends on the fallback rule alone. The group boundaries mirror
# .sdlc/config.env so a change to that config is the only place this list
# needs to follow.

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
* @luissiviero

# PROTECTED_PATHS in .sdlc/config.env: control-plane paths an agent may
# never edit; a human must review any change here.
/.claude/hooks/ @luissiviero
/.github/workflows/ @luissiviero
/.sdlc/ @luissiviero
/.gemini/ @luissiviero
/.claude/settings.json @luissiviero
/scripts/verify.sh @luissiviero
/scripts/run_tests.py @luissiviero
/scripts/run_evals.sh @luissiviero
/scripts/checks/ @luissiviero

# RELEASE_GATED_PATHS in .sdlc/config.env: paths that always need a named
# human approver in the PR per REVIEW.md.
/migrations/ @luissiviero
/infra/ @luissiviero
/terraform/ @luissiviero
/helm/ @luissiviero
